# Generated at API startup and in CI (`python -m matrix_kernel.build_validation_report`
# plus write_credibility_report). GET /validation and GET /credibility serve them when
# present. Not committed — CI uploads them as artifacts so the ledger is reproducible,
# not whatever the last laptop produced. Without the SUMO net, VAL-01 is NOT_RUN
# (honest); a live FAIL publishes when a baseline exists (CR-014).
validation_report.json
validation_report.md
credibility_report.json
packages/kernel/validation_report.json
packages/kernel/credibility_report.json
